"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2022-12-16T17:53:08.296Z"},{"id":"j3-45q_LQ","title":"SF Data Weekly - Next Year in Data Engineering, Redshift at 10 and Annotation","url":"https://www.getrevue.co/profile/sfdata/issues/sf-data-weekly-next-year-in-data-engineering-redshift-at-10-and-annotation-1486851","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/sf-data-weekly---next-year-in-data-engineering-redshift-at-10-and-annotation-j3-45q-lq","summary":"SF Data Weekly: Next Year in Data Engineering, Redshift at 10 and Annotation. This week's pick is a set of predictions for data engineering in 2023. We also have a piece on Redshift\u2019s 10th birthday, as well as one on the importance of data annotation for Machine Learning.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/56b88cf5e211b944c5b7d193f0f0bffb","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2022-12-09T17:44:10.623Z"},{"id":"6O_UGhvrR","title":"SF Data Weekly - World Cup Lineups, Avoiding GIGO and Product Analytics","url":"https://www.getrevue.co/profile/sfdata/issues/sf-data-weekly-world-cup-lineups-avoiding-gigo-and-product-analytics-1476777","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/sf-data-weekly---world-cup-lineups-avoiding-gigo-and-product-analytics-6o-ughvrr","summary":"SF Data Weekly: World Cup Lineups, Avoiding GIGO and Product Analytics. This week's pick is a data-driven effort to create the best lineup for each national team in the World Cup. We also have a piece on avoiding Garbage In Garbage Out.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/8836fff8a9518ad8902083b7175db22d","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2022-12-02T17:34:50.392Z"},{"id":"KeKVPBwBw","title":"SF Data Weekly - World Cup Goals, Pandas Alternative and Basketball Dataviz","url":"https://www.getrevue.co/profile/sfdata/issues/sf-data-weekly-world-cup-goals-pandas-alternative-and-basketball-dataviz-1466543","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/sf-data-weekly---world-cup-goals-pandas-alternative-and-basketball-dataviz-kekvpbwbw","summary":"SF Data Weekly: World Cup Goals, Pandas Alternative and Basketball Dataviz. We also have an alternative to Pandas for quicker data analysis, as well as an interview with the King of Twitter basketball data visualization. Learn six tips on how to build APIs faster.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/5dfe9868fb20b4114f757f1663072621","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2022-11-25T17:22:35.005Z"},{"id":"DlIDrioln","title":"SF Data Weekly - Data Engineer Types, Oversimplification and Supply Chain","url":"https://www.getrevue.co/profile/sfdata/issues/sf-data-weekly-data-engineer-types-oversimplification-and-supply-chain-1455019","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/sf-data-weekly---data-engineer-types-oversimplification-and-supply-chain-dlidrioln","summary":"SF Data Weekly: Data Engineer Types, Oversimplification and Supply Chain. The role of data engineer has morphed drastically in the last decade. We also have a piece on the dangers of oversimplifying data visualizations, and the right analytics for supply chains.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/16dae8dc24fdc3aca0700371a8dfb759","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2022-11-18T17:42:29.143Z"},{"id":"xwEbjQrih","title":"SF Data Weekly - Data Science Rules, Nulls and Phlare","url":"https://www.getrevue.co/profile/sfdata/issues/sf-data-weekly-data-science-rules-nulls-and-phlare-1441952","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/sf-data-weekly---data-science-rules-nulls-and-phlare-xwebjqrih","summary":"SF Data Weekly: Data Science Rules, Nulls and Phlare. We also have a discussion of Nulls in SQL, and an introduction to the new GrafanaPhlare open source database.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/8e20ca17035bd99494e3c63784f0def9","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2022-11-11T17:14:39.